# Who has to review what.
#
# A pull request touching one of these paths automatically requests a review
# from the owner listed beside it, and cannot merge without one. The last
# matching rule wins, so the more specific paths sit at the bottom.
#
# The point of this file is the session materials. Notebooks under `modules/`
# are generated by the scripts in `tools/`, and which of them are published is
# controlled by the embargo block at the bottom of `.gitignore`. A change to
# any of those three can publish a notebook before its class has run, so none
# of them merges without the lead trainer reading the diff.

# Everything, unless a later rule overrides it.
*                @rejusam

# Session materials and the embargo. Lead trainer only.
/modules/        @rejusam
/tools/          @rejusam
/.gitignore      @rejusam
/.github/        @rejusam

